      "value": "this seems to be also related to culling. If you are not looking at the person, the pen draws at their hip.  When you look back it jumps back to where their IK is, making a quick jag down and back. I don’t have good information on the difference between builds unfortunately. The IK lag previously was such that any line was illegible so it was hard to tell.",
